# ZUZUSD/ is the SD-card staging directory (see Makefile's "SD card
# workflow" section). bin/, boot/, and lib/*.a are all regenerated from
# source by `make sdimg-stage`/`uboot-stage`, so they're ignored like any
# other build output (lib/*.a is already caught by the blanket *.a rule
# above). Non-generated resources placed directly under ZUZUSD/ (headers,
# config files, vendored non-build assets) are tracked normally.
ZUZUSD/*